1785619361624805	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEyhQg		item.create	bn-3sypm	{"description":"# Context\nINV-004's last undelivered dimension (plan.md:2751: evidence-graph-edge requires checker on CHECKED_BY). bn-24i found no operation among the 72 appends an edge; bn-i4aem deferred inventing the surface as F14 because RFC 0038 must first decide: which node kind a CHECKED_BY edge's to-handle names (run/certificate/receipt), edge_id derivation, and edge-creation authority (RFC 0038's Authority section covers only node creation and status promotion). A 73rd operation is a plan §10.2 + RFC 0027 registry + IDL change together (F13 precedent).\n# Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] RFC 0038 decides the three questions with direction recorded.\n- [ ] The edge surface added across plan §10.2 + RFC 0027 registry + IDL + continuumd (one coordinated change per the F13 precedent), or the requirement rescoped with the decision recorded.\n- [ ] INV-004's plan §2 heading annotated delivered once every control is mechanically evidenced (the bn-11yx/bn-24i groundwork is recorded on those bones).\n- [ ] just check green.","kind":"task","title":"RFC 0038: evidence-edge wire surface (F14) — CHECKED_BY checker binding"}	blake3:Cf0P66kn0N6bMANs6lNcbhQ9ajwh3e20cHotST2xNUs
