1785872374059862	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEy1wo		item.comment	bn-3rqvm	{"body":"Lead: reviewed and merged @ epoch 224f16c. Ratifications: (1) registry mapping honest — no workspace.import exists, create covers it; workspace.diff correctly EXCLUDED from snapshot (it is PR-12's semantic-diff read and belongs beside it when served). (2) AnswerShape derived from the response BODY never the envelope status, both arms driven live from one fixture, and the A12 no-execution-claim discipline pinned with an explicit no-started-work-words test — exactly the bn-y9f7i disposition made operational. (3) submit-and-print-handle RATIFIED: a poll loop is ambient state (INV-002) plus a client-side stopping rule with no daemon counterpart; verification.await with required --timeout-ms is the protocol's own bounded wait; suspensions printed, never waited on. (4) The idempotency-key latent defect is a real catch — operation-scoped fix + --idempotency-key override accepted; the not-content-derived residual routed to bn-jmx97 (req:pr-13). (5) large_enum_variant allow with the continuum-mcp-identical justification accepted. INV-008 verbatim-rendering pin (inconclusive+ResourceExhausted+bounded in all three formats) is the acceptance criterion made mechanical. CLI 99 tests, workspace 2,460."}	blake3:1hkM_Ub4e8w7cF5b2xetng-HZJn2taxtkpJVU1hcvZo
