1785885927057492	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEysws		item.create	bn-2nwpg	{"description":"bn-8mlg delivered properties::formula_relation/finite_formula_relation — a sound, bounded (4096-step, fail-closed) Finite-fragment implication oracle, and already delegated fairness.rs's condition arm to it (zero behavior change, pinned). bn-7vg7's assumptions.rs still fails closed to unknown on every unequal expression because no oracle existed at its landing. This bone: wire assumptions.rs's content axis to the oracle where the cross-walk honestly holds (dangerous direction for assumptions is STRENGTHENED — the antitone mirror of properties; confirm dualize semantics against RFC 0031/0037 before wiring), upgrade the fail-closed unknown to decided strengthened/weakened where the oracle decides, keep fail-closed everywhere else. Both workers' upgrade-path notes are in bn-8mlg's and bn-7vg7's bone comments. Evidence bar: family standard (real-corpus closure into PolicyTable::verdict, disguise sweeps, anti-vacuity mutants both directions, decided + undecidable-therefore-closed cases).","kind":"task","labels":["req:pr-12","implementation"],"size":"s","title":"semantic-diff: wire assumptions.rs (and audit fairness) to the bn-8mlg Finite implication oracle"}	blake3:JzBs728i1rb8C7fTC5gkV1WYgYi5XEtqMTtl0RbxwZo
1785885933668255	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEytAs		item.create	bn-181aj	{"description":"Three textual gaps the PR-12 classifier family surfaced, each recorded in bone comments, none yet dispositioned in the RFC: (1) bn-8mlg: RFC 0031's two iffs collide on a proven equivalence with unequal encodings — there is no 'equivalent' token, so properties.rs fails closed to unknown; candidate correction (either bless unknown as the deliberate answer or mint the token — wire-visible if the latter, so it would ride the next protocol bundle bn-3jrtz, not this bone). (2) bn-7vg7: RFC 0031's gaming-move table has no row for assumptions despite naming assumption strengthening as a G3 dimension two paragraphs earlier — editorial gap. (3) bn-8mlg + bn-7vg7 both hit the same textual silence: a compound move (kind/observer flip AND expression edit together, or expression+declaredness together) is unstated; both modules resolved to unknown/fail-closed — ratify that resolution as a correction or state a different rule. House correction style, numbered, no renumbering. If any disposition is wire-visible, record it as a flag for bn-3jrtz instead of changing schema surface here.","kind":"task","labels":["req:pr-12","docs"],"size":"s","title":"RFC 0031 text dispositions from the classifier family: equivalence-without-token, assumptions gaming-table row, compound-move silence"}	blake3:M2Vg9xX8OLkkwLo_dRakHCvSlYKMY9h32EbifsQx9NM
