1785892546085591	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEy5As		item.comment	bn-3990	{"body":"Lead: merged @ epoch 1d1e17b4b724. DX-12 ANSWERED YES at production grain: 16 tests, four roles as principals over the real dispatch wire, every unauthorized channel (A1–A5 intent authority, B1–B5 evidence graph, C1 status-via-evidence) refused by a typed check with the record unchanged and observable; three clean baselines; two fail-open mutants prove the gates load-bearing; replay converges-or-mints-distinct, never silently rewrites. Scope honestly bounded: single-threaded = RFC 0038's linearized-per-claim model (concurrency stays DX-13's), classifier grain cited to DX-02. The propose_revision UnsupportedSemanticFeature boundary recorded — the lock is what holds intent stable. Row → Evidence (reference implementation); DX-12 satisfied. Label re-covers done pre-close per the worker's correct flag: req:phase-a-del-04 → bn-wco1 (PR-7 exit, the deliverable's completion gate; subscribe/whiteboard/query-set residuals recorded there implicitly), req:phase-a-del-09 → bn-762i (Phase A protocol parity IS the DX-10 adjudication). Closing."}	blake3:OgiVad7Yv5zaXVDvF3oPGrMyypCxXYTU973PVGV3TOI
