1785902114228759	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEy-As		item.comment	bn-wco1	{"body":"PR-7 exit DELIVERED at exit grain: crates/continuumd/tests/pr7_exit_evidence.rs (7 tests, committed in-workspace @775da6f), START_HERE PR-7 Exit line annotated (delivered: bn-wco1), traceability regenerated in-workspace (PR-7 and PR-7-EXIT flip to satisfied; 653 active, 0 untraced). just check exit 0 (fmt/lint/test/boundaries/covenant/governance/dossier/lean). NOT merged/closed.\n\nThe exit sentence, quantified over the spelled paths (IDL + RFC 0038, never invented): (P0) direct status write is UNSPELLABLE — closed transitive scan over every request shape the live registry declares finds exactly one status-typed field on any @mutation, evidence.verify's CAS guard (the three others are @readonly filters); deliberately version-robust (no 73/3.3 count pin — bn-3jrtz's 3.4 bundle is in flight; the scan quantifies over the live registry and fails loudly only on a genuine new promotion surface). (P1/P2) guard named as validated and as proved: StatusConflict, nothing written. (P3/P4) edge mint over another's and over its own claim: CapabilityDenied at RFC 0038's scheme gate, at execute level so the refusal is attributable to status authority, not the ladder. (P5/P6) both T4 masquerades: CapabilityDenied. (P7) replay: per-actor ledger + admission-precedes-ledger + byte-perfect replay converges on the recorded outcome without executing; even the AUTHORIZED check edge moves no status. Throughout, the proposal's wire record is byte-identical before/after as the attacker itself reads it back via evidence.get, and evidence.query over {validated,proved} answers empty. Ceiling stated: the one client-causable write is the daemon's own check, landing observed under the service's identity whoever asked. POSITIVE CONTROL: the same untrusted principal's real CONTCERT artifact promoted to validated by the trusted service on continuum-kernel-core's own verdict, service-attributed with basis — exit non-vacuous, and the honest road shown. MUTANT (dx12 precedent at exit grain): same principal under service: scheme flips exactly the edge-mint refusal; self-certification moves from scheme denial to INV-004 InsufficientEvidence; no status moves anywhere. Type-level half CITED not duplicated (bn-2c8l's three compile_fail + UNTRUSTED_CEILING; bn-24i's four-place INV-004 boundary incl. the private-constructor Promotion witness), campaign half cited (dx12 B1-B5 + mutants) — both behind freshness tripwires that rot loudly. Honesty recorded in the module doc: validated/proved witnessed at validated (proved is Lean, PR 28, asserted absent not assumed); certificate node filed through state because no wire op appends certificate-class (daemon_evidence.rs idiom — attacks all stay wire-reachable); capability possession is identity at dispatch grain (transport secrecy is PR-5's).\n\nLABEL CARE — LEAD ACTION REQUIRED AT CLOSE: this bone is the SOLE ACTIVE carrier of req:phase-a-del-04 (bn-3990 and bn-3rqvm are done; the label was re-covered here at bn-3990's close). The deliverable's remaining substance is NOT built by this bone and stays disclosed unbuilt: evidence.subscribe event channel (typed-refused today), the whiteboard compiler, and the full RFC 0038 query set (proof/repair frontier, semantic duplicates, task generation). Re-cover req:phase-a-del-04 onto an active successor before/at close or traceability fails uncovered. Plan §21's evidence-graph deliverable was deliberately NOT annotated complete; the regenerated phase-deliverable row correctly stays active."}	blake3:eOCcQ5xyaI-GvRkO-TFQvbak8lGUcSEPTvHWviHQ2wY
1785902157976823	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEy-Qs		item.create	bn-3080b	{"description":"Successor carrier for PHASE-A-DEL-04 (evidence graph) after PR-7 fully exited (bn-wco1). The deliverable's remaining substance, recorded at bn-3990's and bn-wco1's closes: the evidence.subscribe notification channel, the whiteboard compiler, and the full query set beyond evidence.query's landed forms. Scope from RFC 0038 + the IDL's declared-but-unserved surface; each piece may split at pickup. The PR-7 exit (untrusted-cannot-promote) and DX-12 (swarm authority) are DONE — this bone is the constructive remainder, not the security surface.","kind":"task","labels":["req:phase-a-del-04","req:pr-7","implementation"],"size":"m","title":"Evidence graph remaining surface: evidence.subscribe channel, whiteboard compiler, full query set"}	blake3:p9s5fj-r-6aN_CAzMKV4ibFA-oqTX07_aYGiQa8Y9CE
1785902164999196	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEy-gs		item.comment	bn-wco1	{"body":"Lead: merged @ epoch bc60923ae019. PR-7 exit accepted: the P0 closed transitive scan over every live-registry request shape (exactly one status-typed field, verify's CAS guard) is the right quantifier — and version-robust by design against the in-flight 3.4 bundle, a new status-bearing field fails loudly rather than silently widening. Exit witness byte-identical before/after as the attacker reads it back; ceiling lands observed under the service's identity; positive control promotes non-vacuously; replay converges without executing and even the authorized edge moves no status; the service-scheme mutant flips exactly the edge-mint while self-cert stays refused. Type-level half cited behind freshness tripwires, not duplicated. PR 7 FULLY EXITED. DEL-04 re-covered onto the new evidence-graph-remainder bone (subscribe channel, whiteboard compiler, full query set) created pre-close per the worker's flag. Closing."}	blake3:ucvRuswIgDOmjvlY3iumvAY8s7iNISgpuj3dgAh3snY
