1785953554510646	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEyoAw		item.comment	bn-2lq8	{"body":"INV-009 (Monotonic task evidence) evidence delivered. One new test file, zero src/ changes, zero existing tests touched. just check exit 0 from workspace root.\n\nDELIVERABLE: crates/continuumd/tests/inv009_monotonic_task_evidence.rs (8 tests, all passing).\n\nFACET -> LIVE ENFORCEMENT SITE -> OWNING SUITE (cited, not re-derived):\n- resume MAY add evidence, MUST NOT replace prior artifacts -> Publications::committed is append-only, no removal path compiles -> pr6_impl02_budget_evidence.rs::committed_partial_evidence_is_named_and_the_names_only_grow (both.starts_with(&first))\n- a lowered ceiling never silently rewrites recorded results -> budget::bounds_of floors the bound at recorded spend (limit.max(committed)); UpdateOutcome::Suspend is B18 in daemon::task::update_budget's five-arm table -> pr6_impl02::lowering_below_committed_spend_parks_with_evidence_and_a_continuation; unit a_ceiling_below_committed_spend_is_recorded_and_does_not_shrink_the_walk\n- cost dimensions accumulate; spend monotone, only headroom refunds -> BudgetLedger::charge (all-or-nothing), reserve/settle/release refund headroom never spend, charge_states charges the delta (high-water mark) -> continuum-task/src/budget.rs unit suite; pr6_impl02::a_resumed_run_charges_the_difference_rather_than_the_sum; budget_update.rs::the_update_legality_table_holds_in_every_row (\"an update never rewrites recorded spend\", every row)\n- \"committed spend\" = recorded, non-refundable spend (ratified reading, not last checkpoint) -> Suspension doc + BudgetLedger::update compares against spend -> budget_update.rs::lowering_between_the_checkpoint_and_the_live_spend_still_parks\n- committed-evidence count monotone across checkpoints -> BudgetLedger::checkpoint refuses CheckpointRegressesCommitted -> committed_evidence_is_monotone_across_checkpoints\n- terminal status never changes; no ledger write below a terminal check -> TaskEntry::advance refuses every terminal exit; task.resume's terminal check ABOVE its ledger write (bn-10093 / DX-03 DEFECT 2 / bn-3p32 A1 / bn-1kp6 attack 18); update_budget answers Unchanged for terminal -> dx03_falsification.rs::regression_resume_refuses_the_terminal_budget_write_update_budget_refuses; daemon_task_operations.rs::resuming_a_terminal_task_changes_nothing\n- re-derived artifact gets a NEW identity, never overwrite -> budget::publication_commitment derives from campaign canonical bytes (sequence included) -> two_daemons_name_one_campaigns_publications_identically\n- uncommitted partial absent, never half-visible -> Publications linear typestate (stage->commit|discard, no third exit) -> an_uncommitted_partial_is_absent_never_half_visible\n- cancel leaves committed evidence + continuation, or nothing published (B19) -> task.cancel request->drain->finalize -> bn-1n6r pr6_exit_evidence.rs (both instrumented-phase + second-daemon continuation tests)\n- frontier after resume includes frontier before it -> BFS prefix admission, verification::run debug_assert on prod path -> daemon_task_operations.rs::budget_exhaustion_parks_a_continuation_that_update_budget_and_resume_complete\n- committed partial survives restart; uncommitted does not -> bn-3dr durable substrate + recovery reconcile -> g1_crash_recovery_evidence.rs (both conjuncts)\n- region + budget accountings agree on what was committed -> EvidenceBook::reconcile (third independent accounting) -> budget_partial_evidence.rs::the_two_accountings_reconcile_at_every_interleaving\n\nbn-23j7s FIX VERIFIED LIVE (not re-derived): the REAL INV-009 silent-truncation defect it found — a lowered ceiling became the engine bound directly, so the next task.resume re-ran the campaign smaller and a monotone cost.states went DOWN. Fix = bounds_of's limit.max(committed) floor in src/daemon/budget.rs. the_bn23j7s_floor_is_live_and_its_guards_still_exist pins the floor string, both unit guards, and the wire regression guard incl. its defect-statement doc; negative_the_sweeps_are_not_vacuous carries the pre-fix mutant shape and confirms the floor check rejects it.\n\nWHAT THIS FILE ADDS (4 things genuinely missing): (1) the whole-trace restatement — cost/artifacts/milestones read after EVERY dispatch across all five update arms + both resume shapes, monotone+prefix-preserving at every adjacent pair, ending on the Completed-task terminal arm (the case DEFECT 2's Cancelled-task guard doesn't cover); (2) a removal-verb sweep over the 5 declared append-only containers (Publications::committed, TaskEntry milestones/events/committed_evidence, BudgetLedger::checkpoints) with 4 mutants; (3) freshness tripwires on every citation (test names + load-bearing assertion strings pinned against tracked text); (4) the two honest gaps as typed absences.\n\nHONEST GAPS (typed absences, pinned to go red):\n- boundary_evidence_graph_handles_have_no_task_producer_yet: TaskEntry.committed_evidence declared append-only + carried on the wire, but NO producer — verification.rs inits it empty, no committed_evidence.push anywhere in the daemon. The \"may add evidence\" clause is discharged TODAY by the publications list; a task reports task.committed_evidence as a typed unsupported omission (INV-007), verified live. Goes red the day the evidence-graph task wiring lands a producer.\n- boundary_daemon_grain_monotonicity_is_enforced_for_the_one_metered_dimension: budget::METERS == MeterSet::STATES_ONLY, pinned by equality. Daemon-grain monotonic evidence is about states; the other 8 dimensions' ledger monotonicity is unit-proven in budget_dimensions.rs (cited) and their declared ceilings are typed omissions here. A widened meter set turns this red.\n\nANNOTATE-VS-DECLINE DECISION: ANNOTATE. Plan Section 2 INV-009 heading annotated \"(delivered: bn-2lq8 — ...)\". Reasoning per bn-n9a1's rule (annotate when the invariant's obligation is fully dischargeable today with gaps that are ABSENCES stated inline; decline when substance hasn't arrived): INV-009's substance HAS arrived and is structurally enforced end to end — the append-only publications list, the bounds_of floor (the real defect, found+fixed+guarded by bn-23j7s), monotone irrevocable spend, the checkpoint regression refusal, the terminal-check-above-ledger-write ordering, and cancel/restart both-or-neither are all live and mechanically tested. The two gaps are true ABSENCES (an unwired evidence-graph list already discharged another way, and eight unmetered dimensions honestly reported as omissions), not missing substance; both are pinned to force a revisit rather than left to prose. Annotate is honest here, consistent with INV-008's ratified rule of thumb.\n\nREGEN: ran just traceability in-workspace; PLAN_REQUIREMENTS.json + PLAN_BONE_TRACEABILITY.md updated (invariant INV-009 active->satisfied; invariant tally 9->8 active / 9->10 satisfied). Committed in-workspace.\n\nGATES: just check exit 0 (fmt-check, clippy -D warnings, full workspace test, crate-boundary + kernel-covenant + governance self-tests, dossier validate, lean lake build + axiom-manifest --check, spikes). Determinism honored (INV-005): the one timestamp is the fixture constant, no ambient time/entropy/iteration-order.\n\nCommitted in-workspace (9d03196); NOT merged/pushed/closed per protocol."}	blake3:0-dEohiDSTi9blT45uy1PIJOuuXZlQ2h0E9Zn30zAZU
1785953613609052	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEyoQw		item.comment	bn-2lq8	{"body":"Lead: merged @ epoch a432b93582d0. INV-009 ANNOTATED (delivered) — the adjudication is right: all 12 monotonicity facets structurally enforced end-to-end (append-only publications, bounds_of floor, monotone irrevocable spend, checkpoint-regression refusal, terminal-check-above-ledger-write), the two gaps genuine typed absences not missing substance. The bn-23j7s silent-truncation fix (lowered ceiling became engine bound → cost.states went DOWN; fix = bounds_of's limit.max(committed) floor) is freshness-pinned and its regression guard verified LIVE with the pre-fix mutant shape asserted-rejected — cited not re-derived, exactly the discipline. Four genuinely new checks (whole-trace monotone+prefix-preserving read after every dispatch across all five update_budget arms ending on the Completed terminal arm no prior guard hit; removal-verb sweep over the 5 append-only containers with 4 mutants; freshness tripwires; typed-absence gaps). §2 invariant sweep now: 001/002/003/005/006/008/009/012/016 delivered. Closing."}	blake3:P0Fd5RZbeJXNf8UKzP7EzDNTgISJTUyZbQkleXFQozY
