1786294935675708	continuum-dev	itc:v3:AWKSTzM5JJnJPkQAAAAAQar23VW6voAAAAEy9gw		item.comment	bn-21vno	{"body":"Delivered via parent workspace bn-8g9uj, merged @ 90bdba8384c7 (commit fb0c0ad): stages 1-2 in crates/continuum-context — closed 13-member Guarantee in schema order (INV-003 over RFC 0028's table order, divergence documented), C1 as a type with pub(crate) License constructor + compile_fail doctest, engine-independent CausalOrder with independent closure_violation checker and declared Completeness (slice-irrelevant only under complete order, else heuristic-cutoff), all-ten-stage StageTrail with Redaction at ordinal 0 refusing repeated/out-of-order phases (correction 12 checked), compile run refusing redacted roots and unanchored residual queries, slicing whole-order so redaction holes cost the guarantee. 15 integration tests at DX-01 grain incl. 225→4-core with 221 reconciled omissions. Gate exit 0. Shortlex Name ordering finding recorded for later children (esp. bn-1y4qc golden re-bless). Lead ratifies and closes."}	blake3:rbnRGBjgP7SB31zUPsEYqekvs8W0-8iOShrYN3-1WgA
